    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "tip",
      "title": "After this PDF you can",
      "bullets": [
        "use mood to change meaning (dice que viene / dice que venga)",
        "choose mood in relative clauses with superlatives and unique elements (el único que conozca)",
        "use independent subjunctive for wishes, third-person commands and fixed phrases",
        "choose among present, perfect, imperfect and pluperfect subjunctive"
      ]
