    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "warn",
      "title": "de ahí que",
      "text": "<b>De ahí que</b> (hence, that is why) always takes the subjunctive, even though it states a fact: <i>No dormí; de ahí que esté cansado.</i> It is common in academic writing."
