    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "tip",
      "title": "Present main verb + past event",
      "text": "<b>No creo que haya venido</b> (the result matters now) vs <b>No creo que viniera ayer</b> (the event is dated). With a past time word the imperfect subjunctive is natural: <i>Dudo que lo supiera entonces.</i>"
    },
